WEBVTT

00:08:59.243 --> 00:09:01.579
a few hours of play
in the freshly fallen snow.

00:09:03.455 --> 00:09:05.249
With these gestures and so many more,

00:09:05.249 --> 00:09:07.376
our guests were obviously
happier than ever,

00:09:07.376 --> 00:09:08.377
but you know what?

00:09:08.377 --> 00:09:10.629
This is the cool part, 
so was our team.

00:09:10.713 --> 00:09:13.299
Because for the first time,
they had creative autonomy.

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:16.468
They were no longer just helping
to execute someone else's vision,

00:09:16.468 --> 00:09:18.804
serving plates of food
someone else had created.

00:09:18.846 --> 00:09:20.848
They were coming up with their own ideas,

00:09:20.848 --> 00:09:23.559
and those ideas were affecting
the guest experience.

00:09:23.934 --> 00:09:25.561
They were empowered.

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:28.606
But mostly,

00:09:28.647 --> 00:09:30.107
I mean, we were all just happy